### Requisições de exemplo (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Gere o token com: ./scripts/dev-token.sh   (Windows: .\scripts\dev-token.ps1)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = COLE_AQUI_O_TOKEN

### Criar solicitação (201 Created + Location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "EXT-12345",
  "customerId": "CUST-10001",
  "productCode": "INTERNET-500"
}

### Repetir a mesma requisição (200 OK + Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "EXT-12345",
  "customerId": "CUST-10001",
  "productCode": "INTERNET-500"
}

### Mesmo externalId com outro produto (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "EXT-12345",
  "customerId": "CUST-10001",
  "productCode": "TV-200"
}

### Provedor recusa (400 do provedor → status FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "EXT-INVALID-1", "customerId": "CUST-10001", "productCode": "INVALID-PLAN" }

### Provedor lento (timeout → novas tentativas → FAILED após o limite)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "EXT-SLOW-1", "customerId": "CUST-10001", "productCode": "SLOW-PLAN" }

### Provedor instável (502 e depois 200 → COMPLETED com 2 tentativas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "EXT-FLAKY-1", "customerId": "CUST-10001", "productCode": "FLAKY-PLAN" }

### Consultar (substitua pelo id retornado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests?status=COMPLETED&customerId=CUST-10001&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dados inválidos (400 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalId": "EXT 1", "productCode": "INTERNET-500" }

### Health e métricas (porta de gestão)
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health/readiness

###
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus
